                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Rylands R.32528 and R.32548 were formerly
                        together in one binding. MSS. Lat. 185 and 226 were binding leaves in this
                        volume.</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Hain 13679. Proctor 1287.</note>
